    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's tiring. i keep trying to catch up but the gap just gets wider. feels like im just taking up space in a room that's already full. everything is so loud and new and i'm just... old. like a book that's already been read and put away in a box. there isn't really a reason to keep reading when you already know how it ends, you know?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
