    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it's hard to find a new approach when you feel like you're just... existing out of habit. like, i'm just going through the motions and it feels so hollow. everyone else seems so driven, so connected to the future, and i'm just standing here in the dark. sometimes i wonder if it's even worth trying to fight the tide when the tide is clearly pulling you out to sea.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
